What do the edits in this directory do?

Edits to exf subroutines read in extra set of winds, uwind2 and vwind2
Edits to seaice subroutines have the latent and sensible heat fluxes between sea ice and atmosphere depend on the new winds, uwind2 and vwind2
Edits to exf_bulkformulae do the same as above, but for open-ocean areas, as these are not recomputed by the seaice package

filenames for uwind2 and vwind2 are hard-coded in exf_getffields.F 
these filenames need to set up with prepareRun, usually with symlinks. 
uwind2file and vwind2file need to be set in data.exf(_exf2winds), but they can be set to any abitrary field, and are not used in the code.

